  "name": "PII Protection Policy",
  "description": "Global baseline policy for personally identifiable information. Covers universal personal attributes, generic contact information, and formats that apply across all regions. Country-specific contact rules (phone numbers, postal codes) are owned by regional policies that extend this baseline (policy.us-pii, policy.eu-gdpr, policy.uk-data-protection, policy.apac-data-privacy, policy.americas-data-protection, policy.emea-extended).\n\nScope: Global PII protection baseline",
